Usage: AssetRipper.GUI.Free [--headless] [--help] [--local-web-file <string>...] [--log] [--log-path <string>] [--port <int32>] [--version]

        --headless [<boolean>]
            If true, a browser window will not be launched automatically. Default value: False.

    -?, --help [<boolean>] (-h)
            Displays this help message.

        --local-web-file <string>
            Files provided with this option will replace online sources.

        --log [<boolean>]
            If true, the application will log to a file. Default value: True.

        --log-path <string>
            The file location at which to save the log, or a sensible default if not provided.

        --port <int32>
            If nonzero, the application will attempt to host on this port, instead of finding a random unused port. Default value: 0.

        --version [<boolean>]
            Displays version information.

